---
id: radish-scallion-yogurt-salad
title: Classic Radish & Scallion Yogurt Salad
category: fresh_salad_veg

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 239

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Trim the ends off @red-radishes{150%g} and slice into thin half-moons or rounds. Finely chop @green-onions{0.5%bunch}, using both white and green parts. Add both to a small mixing bowl.

Spoon @greek-yogurt-2pct{50%g} over the vegetables and season with @kosher-salt{0.25%tsp} and @black-pepper{0.25%tsp}. Toss gently until the yogurt evenly coats the radishes. Eat immediately to preserve maximum crunch.
